# P13-003: ATTACH surface (TYPE pfile_catalog)

Expose a pfile_catalog matrix as an attachable read-only database, so a cohort
reads like a schema of relations:
`ATTACH 'cohort.pfile.json' AS c (TYPE pfile_catalog)` →
`SELECT * FROM c.variants`, `c.samples`, `c.genotypes`, `c.cells`, …

Depends on: P13-001 (matrix design, owner-approved 2026-10-29), P13-002 (shipped
v0.15.0 — the matrix format + typed-prune readers). Branch:
`feature/P13-003-attach-surface`.

